26
00:01:05,903 --> 00:01:07,903
Thank you. Keep reading. Don't stop.

27
00:01:07,903 --> 00:01:09,883
Okay, so Goldilocks is a story where bears live in houses.

28
00:01:09,887 --> 00:01:10,727
Stop!

29
