441
00:19:05,055 --> 00:19:06,055
Shortcut!

442
00:19:06,055 --> 00:19:08,155
Yeah!

443
00:19:08,159 --> 00:19:08,999
- Whoa!

444
00:19:08,999 --> 00:19:09,819
- Whoa!

445
00:19:09,819 --> 00:19:10,659
- Whoa!

446
00:19:10,659 --> 00:19:11,499
- Whoa!

447
00:19:11,499 --> 00:19:12,339
- Huh?

448
00:19:12,339 --> 00:19:13,159
- Lake?

449
00:19:13,159 --> 00:19:13,999
Lake?

450
00:19:13,999 --> 00:19:14,839
- Lake?

451
00:19:14,839 --> 00:19:16,139
- Oh, we got a little girl.

452
00:19:16,139 --> 00:19:18,139
- Oh, we got a little girl.

