466
00:19:45,111 --> 00:19:46,111
Cat!

467
00:19:46,111 --> 00:19:48,091
Aha!

468
00:19:48,095 --> 00:19:50,095
Nope.

469
00:19:50,095 --> 00:19:51,095
Ah-ha!

470
00:19:51,095 --> 00:19:52,095
Nope.

471
00:19:52,095 --> 00:19:54,095
Ah-ha!

472
00:19:54,095 --> 00:19:56,095
Nope.

473
