486
00:20:28,031 --> 00:20:29,031
Mm-hmm.

487
00:20:29,031 --> 00:20:32,031
When I saw that cookie, then I knew I had to give it to you.

488
00:20:32,031 --> 00:20:35,031
That is so generous of you, Mouse.

489
00:20:35,031 --> 00:20:37,031
