525
00:21:44,379 --> 00:21:45,639
Whee!

526
00:21:45,639 --> 00:21:46,639
Wait for me!

527
00:21:46,639 --> 00:21:47,899
Hey, wait!

528
00:21:47,903 --> 00:21:49,403
Oh, yeah!

529
00:21:49,403 --> 00:21:50,903
Yay!

530
00:21:52,903 --> 00:21:55,603
What a great surprise.

531
00:21:55,603 --> 00:21:57,883
But all that running around and detectiving sure made

532
00:21:57,887 --> 00:21:58,887
