542
00:22:21,415 --> 00:22:23,415
And you never know what's next

543
00:22:24,095 --> 00:22:25,915
Let's go to unexpected places

544
00:22:25,915 --> 00:22:27,835
They'll leave us smiling in faces

545
00:22:27,839 --> 00:22:29,339
