546
00:22:29,419 --> 00:22:30,759
So come on, come along.

547
00:22:31,179 --> 00:22:32,639
If you gave a mouse a cookie,

548
00:22:33,119 --> 00:22:34,499
you'll never know what you get.

549
00:22:34,979 --> 00:22:36,459
If you gave a mouse a cookie,

550
00:22:36,999 --> 00:22:37,799
what do you think?

551
00:22:37,823 --> 00:22:39,063
will happen next.

